{
  "uid": "asap-topk",
  "title": "Heavy hitters: sketch vs exact vs Raw (real collector containers)",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-35m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Three ways to answer, every minute: which client addresses sent the most requests in the last 5 minutes (top talkers), and which are new?",
      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0 6px;border:none\"><tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 10px 0 0;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:middle\"><b style=\"color:#5794f2\">Sketch</b><br><small>summarize each minute at the source</small></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>Sources A and B</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">generator-a/b</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>Summarize each minute: Count-Min sketch + top-20 list</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">branch-a/b</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>Combine A and B</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">merge</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>Merge the last 5 minutes; top clients, and which are new</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">detector</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>Store the answer</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">prometheus-sketch</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>Query: read the answer</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">query-job</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 0 0 12px;vertical-align:middle;max-width:360px\"><small style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">PromQL</small><br><code style=\"font-size:11px;white-space:normal\">asap_topk{method=&quot;sketch&quot;, bound=&quot;estimate&quot;} (the stored 5-minute answer; no range: nothing to compute)</code></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 10px 0 0;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:middle\"><b style=\"color:#ff9830\">Exact</b><br><small>count every client each minute</small></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>Sources A and B (same points)</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">exact-generator-a/b</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>Count every client address each minute</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">exact-branch-a/b</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>Add up A and B</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">exact-merge</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>Add up the last 5 minutes; top clients, and which are new</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">exact-detector</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>Store the answer</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">prometheus-exact</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>Query: read the answer</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">query-job</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 0 0 12px;vertical-align:middle;max-width:360px\"><small style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">PromQL</small><br><code style=\"font-size:11px;white-space:normal\">asap_topk{method=&quot;exact&quot;, bound=&quot;estimate&quot;} (the stored 5-minute answer; no range: nothing to compute)</code></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 10px 0 0;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:middle\"><b style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">Raw</b><br><small>store every point, compute when asked</small></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>Sources A and B (same points)</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">raw-generator-a/b</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>Forward each point as it arrives (OTLP forwarder, no window)</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">raw-sink-a/b</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>Store every point</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">prometheus-raw</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>Query: compute the top 20 of the last 5 minutes</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">query-job</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none\"></td><td style=\"border:none\"></td><td style=\"border:none\"></td><td style=\"border:none\"></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 0 0 12px;vertical-align:middle;max-width:360px\"><small style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">PromQL</small><br><code style=\"font-size:11px;white-space:normal\">topk(20, sum by (client_address) (count_over_time(http_server_request_duration[5m])))</code></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0\"><small>Same input for all three. The rate per source ramps up and back down every 40 minutes, again and again (5k, 10k, 20k, 40k, 80k, 40k, 20k, 10k points/s, 5 minutes each). Requests come from client addresses drawn Zipf(1.0) over 20 million IPv4 addresses: about 1 million distinct per 5 minutes at the lowest rate, about 7 million at the highest. Once: a new client, <code>203.0.113.7</code>, takes 15% of traffic at minute 10. Every step is one container pinned to one CPU; each approach has its own Prometheus.</small></p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0\"><small>Raw adds a <code>point_slot</code> label so points of one client address in the same millisecond stay separate samples (Prometheus keeps one sample per series and millisecond). hh-accuracy compares Sketch with Exact; query-job compares Raw with Exact and times every approach&#39;s query.</small></p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0\"><small>Every approach answers over the last 5 minutes, once a minute. Sketch and Exact read the stored answer (evaluated at the minute&#39;s end, keeping the samples stamped with it). Raw computes it from every raw point of the last 5 minutes (evaluated 1 ms before the minute&#39;s end, because PromQL ranges include their end).</small></p>"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1
    },
