      },
      "description": "Every hop of the approach: the raw points from the generators into its first stage, then sketch and exact: sketches / exact maps into merge and merged windows into detector; Raw: every raw point from otlp-forwarder into prometheus-raw. The answers into the approach's Prometheus (a few kilobytes per window) are not counted.",
